      "type": "reflect",
      "kicker": "Tell me what you know",
      "prompt": "In your own words, what is liquidity?",
      "modelAnswer": "Liquidity is about the orders available to trade: buyers and sellers willing to transact. Obvious levels like previous highs may attract resting orders, like take-profits, stops and breakout orders. I can identify the area, but I can’t know every participant’s motive, and it doesn’t tell me where price must go."
